{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43622","headline":"建安寺夜会对雨怀皇甫侍御曾联句 · 清昼","name":"建安寺夜会对雨怀皇甫侍御曾联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相思非是远，风雨遣情多。\n愿欲披云见，难堪候晓过。\n夜长同岁月，地近极山河。\n戒相初传授，文章旧切磋。\n时称洛下咏，人许郢中歌。\n惆怅徒延首，其如一水何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清昼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43622.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43622","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}